              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela uo ujilaghashagha irangi jake kwa wundu ghwapo uchajipata sena. Ichamfwana mundu kii ukaghupata wurumwengu ghose na kujilaghasha irangi jake? Angu uchafunya kii kuindana na irangi jake? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
