          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namghoria loli, weko wandu aha wisechaafwa anduangi hata wameria kummbona Mwana wa Mdamu ukicha kwa Wuzuri ghwake.”",
          "type": "text",
